# Note formatting in Cloud Foundry docs

Always use `<p class="note">` for notes. Never use markdown blockquote syntax (`>`).

The closing `</p>` must always be on its own line.

**Bad (markdown blockquote):**
```
> **Note** Some important information here.
```

**Bad (closing tag inline):**
```html
<p class="note">Some important information here.</p>
```

**Good:**
```html
<p class="note">Some important information here.
</p>
```

For warnings, use `<p class="note warning">` with the same closing tag rule:

```html
<p class="note warning">Some warning here.
</p>
```
